WEBVTT

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.940
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:34.180
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:39.020
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:43.520
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:46.890
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:51.460
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:56.500
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:59.170
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:01.370
Give thanks!

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:04.580
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:10.380
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:15.520
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:20.790
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:24.960
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:31.040
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:33.840
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:36.410
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.410 --> 00:01:39.010
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:43.280
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:50.290
Someone once said...

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:55.030
There is corn that has the 
texture of bamboo shoots...

00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:57.900
Corncobamboo!

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:05.270
There are trees with sweet 
leaves of moon cakes...

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:10.040
Moon Cake Trees!

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:13.780
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:18.920
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:24.360
Komatsu and Toriko went off 
to see the famous cutler Melk

00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:25.790
so he would make a new knife for Komatsu

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:28.060
and give Toriko information 
about Melk Stardust,

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:30.800
an ingredient he's tracking 
down for his training!

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:35.100
Instead, they encountered a person who 
claimed to be the second generation Melk!

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:38.970
Toriko clasped to his chest what 
could be called Komatsu's life,

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:42.770
one of the chef's knives, and 
set off for Heavy Hole, an area

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:45.210
where gravity is several times 
what it is on the surface

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:47.250
and where the first Melk was said to be.

00:02:48.110 --> 00:02:53.220
Meanwhile, Komatsu stayed back and 
attentively watched Melk work.

00:02:56.750 --> 00:03:01.430
Hidden Truth! The First Melk Appears!

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:11.500
Beautiful...

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:14.910
The knife is broken and yet still 
gives off such a presence...

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:18.380
Chef Komatsu's soul dwells 
within this knife...

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:21.280
It isn't dead yet.

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:25.620
That was a nice bath.

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:27.020
Did it warm you up?

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:30.220
Warm as toast...

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:32.720
What's with your underpants?!

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:37.500
Sorry. I have knife-type underwear, 
too, but thought that might be

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:40.500
appealing to you a little too obviously, 
so I went with the meat version.

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:42.730
You don't need to appeal to me that way!

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:44.400
Hurry up and get dressed!

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:45.470
Sure.

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:47.440
After getting nice and 
warm in the hot spring,

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:49.210
I bet I'll sleep like a log tonight!

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:52.610
You shouldn't work too hard either, 
Melk-san. Please get some rest.

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:08.790
Um, Toriko-san...

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:10.130
You said "division of labor".

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:12.900
So basically, what should I do?

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:14.500
You don't have to do anything.

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:18.840
Just staying with Melk is fine.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:19.570
But...

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:22.840
It's something I can't do, but is 
an important job for you alone.

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:26.280
Just stay with Melk-san...?

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:28.110
What did he mean by that?

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:36.350
W-Why am I so shaken up?

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:40.530
Just from seeing a half-naked man...

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:53.240
The gravity has increased even more!

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:57.810
So this means I'm at the next stage?

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:07.790
Compared to this gravity, tackling 
the Barbamoths was a piece of cake!

00:05:09.390 --> 00:05:11.760
Not sure if my body will hold out long enough

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:13.620
to get to the lowest point, where Melk is!

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:34.950
The gravity isn't just a burden on my body...

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:37.320
It's also causing mental 
stress and having an effect

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:39.050
on my autonomic nervous system!

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:44.060
My heart's beating fast and I feel dizzy...

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:45.990
And my head's pounding!

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:52.430
The blood is accumulating in my legs... 
and not flowing up to my brain?!

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:54.200
I'm in hot water...

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:03.610
Komatsu's knife!

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:06.210
Hang in there, Toriko-san!

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:07.580
Komatsu!

00:06:08.480 --> 00:06:10.580
Sorry about that, Komatsu...

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:13.620
Made you worry about me...

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:18.690
If something happens to me...

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:26.430
...nobody will be around to protect 
this guy, Komatsu's "life".

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:30.770
Komatsu's knife...

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:35.810
This thing I have to protect 
definitely gives me strength!

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:43.650
The glowing stones known as Shine Rocks...

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:46.720
So their light reflected off of this, huh?

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:50.090
Get my body used to the gravity...

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:51.690
...as I descend slowly...

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:53.560
...little by little...

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:58.930
Unsurprisingly, this far down...

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:00.700
...the gravity's more intense than ever!

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:03.570
I must weigh nearly a ton now.

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:08.640
Moving normally would be too 
much of a burden on my body.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:16.780
Moving...

00:07:16.780 --> 00:07:20.220
I've got to move in a way that 
deals with this powerful gravity...

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:24.890
I've got it!

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:30.230
Without opposing the gravity, like 
I'm falling, surrendering myself...

00:07:30.530 --> 00:07:33.160
Move by rolling like a ball...

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:39.770
And by rotating around,

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:42.170
the gravity doesn't force the 
blood to gather in my legs...

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:46.310
Still, this gravity is many 
times what it is topside...

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:48.580
And I haven't eaten anything for a while,

00:07:48.580 --> 00:07:51.080
so I don't think my physical strength 
will hold out all the way to the bottom!

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:54.790
I've got to replenish myself with food 
from somewhere and recover my strength!

00:07:56.550 --> 00:07:57.560
Crap!

00:07:57.560 --> 00:07:58.520
Wait!

00:07:58.520 --> 00:07:59.590
Stop!

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:10.940
Hold on!

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:22.010
That was close...

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:30.290
Th-They're...

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:34.060
Ruby Crab (Crustacea Beast) Capture Level 46

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:31.860
Ruby Crabs!

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:34.190
They're top-grade crabs!

00:08:34.190 --> 00:08:36.360
With their ruby-encrusted shells,

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:38.830
they're a delicacy that rarely 
appears on the market!

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:43.230
That I'd stumble onto a feast like 
this... coincidence or not...

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:45.300
Could it be...?!

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:46.970
Komatsu?!

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:51.980
It's no coincidence. Komatsu's 
soul resides in this knife.

00:08:51.980 --> 00:08:56.280
The knife possesses Komatsu's 
talent to attract ingredients

00:08:56.280 --> 00:08:58.550
and that's what found the Ruby Crabs!

00:08:59.780 --> 00:09:01.920
Thanks, Komatsu!

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:04.620
You saved me.

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:11.160
Once I restore my strength, 
this gravity will be nothin'!

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:16.730
I give thanks for all this world's bounty...

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:18.670
No, Toriko-san!

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:23.880
Don't eat them all! Please leave some for me!

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:28.980
A dream...?

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:35.620
Melk-san...

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:38.060
He's staying up all night again?

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:40.590
Will he be okay?

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:51.170
He's taking a bath!

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:52.940
This is perfect!

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:55.710
Melk-san's been working so hard, 
I'll make him a midnight snack!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:04.220
Delicious!

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:07.220
That's right. If Melk-san drinks 
this while taking a bath,

00:10:07.220 --> 00:10:10.660
it'll make him relax more and 
maybe even ease his fatigue.

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:16.730
That gave me goosebumps, Melk-san!

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:19.460
I was just able to see the 
greatest sharpening in the world!

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:21.870
I feel like I'm on cloud nine!

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:25.800
It's ridiculous...

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:29.540
It's ridiculous to say you've 
got "a long way to go"

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:32.080
when you can make a 
beautiful knife like this.

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:56.900
Melk-san!

00:10:56.900 --> 00:10:59.300
I brought you some late...

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:00.070
...night...

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:00.810
...soup...

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:08.610
There's no...?!

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:13.520
Chef Komatsu!

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:15.990
W-Why am I so flustered?!

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:18.620
M-M-M-M-Melk-san!

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:21.090
What?! Is something wrong, Chef Komatsu?

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:23.730
Suddenly acting like everything's normal?!

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:27.270
No, um... I'm sorry! No... Melk-san, uh...

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:29.900
W-Woman... woman... woman...

00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:33.040
You're a girl?

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:35.010
Yeah. Got a problem with that?

00:11:35.010 --> 00:11:36.940
No problem at all...

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:39.940
Chef Komatsu... We need to talk.

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:43.480
Yes, sure, but first, Melk-san, 
please put on some clothes...

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:53.360
Yummy!

00:11:53.360 --> 00:11:55.830
Ruby Crab is the best!

00:11:55.830 --> 00:11:59.860
Thanks to this gravity, 
I get to taste this firm,

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:03.070
tender flavor that comes 
out the more I chew it...

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:05.470
Ruby Crab really is the best!

00:12:07.110 --> 00:12:09.210
Thank you for the meal!

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:12.110
Now then...

00:12:12.110 --> 00:12:14.780
I don't know who the hell you are...

00:12:15.050 --> 00:12:19.550
...but I presume this is the 
lowest point of Heavy Hole?

00:12:20.950 --> 00:12:22.820
If you want me, come and get me!

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:25.020
I'm already used to the gravity here!

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:44.810
An incredible air of intimidation...

00:12:44.810 --> 00:12:47.310
This guy is strong...

00:12:44.810 --> 00:12:48.650
Scorpion Demon Bull (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 53

00:12:47.310 --> 00:12:49.810
Maybe the master of Heavy Hole?

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:53.720
In this gravity, how far will 
I be able to go with him?

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:55.620
Let's get it on!

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:05.630
What's wrong?

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:07.700
Scared all of a sudden...

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:09.730
I can't believe you're a coward like that...

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:11.340
Wait...

00:13:11.340 --> 00:13:13.910
This environment of strong gravity...

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:17.840
I didn't realize it, but looks 
like it built up my body...

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:22.610
To a level where even the threat of 
me makes a guy like this quiver...

00:13:23.850 --> 00:13:25.050
The scent of a Beast?!

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:28.650
It's not me he's afraid of!

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:49.770
What a quiet voice!

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:53.850
What? You were able to catch that?

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:56.150
I mean, you understood that?!

00:13:56.150 --> 00:13:58.250
H-Hey! Where you goin'?!

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:02.720
D-Don't tell me you're... Cutler Melk?!

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:13.160
That is one quiet voice...

00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:17.440
Uh-oh! What's he doing?

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:19.540
I don't understand a word he's sayin'!

00:14:23.510 --> 00:14:27.510
He took out a rock and is going on 
about something, but what is it?

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:29.550
Is he putting out ultrasonic waves?!

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:32.550
Oh, if only Zebra were here...

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:45.500
No, w-wait a second!

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:47.900
Why are you waving bye-bye?!

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:49.800
You're the first generation Melk, right?!

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:52.670
Yeah, I'm positive it's you!

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:55.410
I came here looking for you!

00:14:57.510 --> 00:15:00.950
What? What? Please, in a big voice!

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:12.690
What the hell?!

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:24.840
His voice got louder!

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:27.570
So it's like I told you before...

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:28.870
Bye.

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:33.080
Whoa, whoa, whoa! Hang on!

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:35.650
I didn't catch one word you said before!

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:36.950
Give it to me once more from the top!

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:39.750
Please, starting with your self-introduction!

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:42.520
In fact, what is that?! A rock 
that makes your voice louder?!

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:46.790
And what is this Beast?! There's a 
ton of stuff I wanna ask you about!

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:50.600
Melk-san... I don't...

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:55.000
This is very good.

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:57.300
As I'd expect from you, Chef Komatsu.

00:15:57.570 --> 00:15:59.440
It's really warming me up.

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:02.170
Y-You're <i>not</i> the second generation...?!

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:07.680
To be precise, I'm not even sure 
if he made me his apprentice.

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:13.580
My master found me in a secluded 
area deep in the mountains...

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:26.860
Apparently, nobody believed that my 
master, the man feared as "Ogre Melk"...

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:30.340
...took in and raised a baby.

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:35.240
But at least I felt it...

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:37.410
The only one in the world...

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:39.310
...to be loved by "Ogre Melk".

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:44.020
So the first Melk-san is 
your surrogate parent?

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:48.120
By and by, I started to take an 
interest in the master's work.

00:16:49.350 --> 00:16:50.790
That's only natural, isn't it?

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:53.390
For a child to be interested 
in her parent's job...

00:16:54.190 --> 00:16:58.660
Except the master never let 
me into his workshop...

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:00.900
That's why...

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:05.100
...I watched secretly.

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:10.380
I snuck in once...

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:11.740
...and an accident happened.

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:29.160
When I look back on that accident 
now, I think of it as a good thing.

00:17:29.660 --> 00:17:33.160
At a young age, I learned 
how scary blades were...

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:41.070
...but I also became aware of their beauty.

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:44.480
It started then...

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:48.750
Little by little, the master 
would show me his work.

00:17:53.180 --> 00:17:57.860
The master sharpened with such 
strength... such incredible force...

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:08.670
I became more and more fascinated.

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:13.470
So then you started on the path to 
becoming a cutler too, Melk-san...

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:16.740
Sounds like a great relationship 
between master and apprentice...

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:17.680
No...

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:19.780
The master never said a word...

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.450
...and he never taught me anything.

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:25.620
I could only learn by watching 
and copying his techniques.

00:18:27.090 --> 00:18:29.990
Every year, about 100 
people visited the master,

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:32.190
hoping to become his disciple...

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:35.790
But no one lasted more than two days.

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:37.260
Two days?!

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:40.970
No one could endure the harsh 
temperament of the master,

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:44.700
the man who could handle everything himself, 
including procuring the materials.

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:50.140
That's why I thought, "I have to get strong!

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:55.250
If I don't become strong, I'll never be 
a first-rate cutler like the master!"

00:18:57.020 --> 00:18:59.650
That's why you were so sensitive 
about strength before...

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:02.490
It was more important to 
me than anything else.

00:19:03.190 --> 00:19:05.160
Strength would prove that I 
was the second generation!

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:07.990
In order to banish my weakness...

00:19:09.260 --> 00:19:13.300
...I tried with all of my might to 
become a strong man, like my master.

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:16.430
But no matter how much effort I put into it,

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:21.970
I couldn't become powerful like the 
master... I couldn't be a strong cutler.

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:27.880
I-I don't understand.

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:32.650
Melk-san, you're doing an excellent 
job as the second generation!

00:19:33.420 --> 00:19:35.490
I mean, aren't you?! Melk-san...

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:44.730
Not once has my master acknowledged me...

00:19:46.630 --> 00:19:49.270
I just call myself the second generation...

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:53.100
I'm sorry, Chef Komatsu.

00:19:53.740 --> 00:19:57.240
Toriko was right. I'm a fake.

00:19:57.240 --> 00:19:59.110
That's not true!

00:19:59.780 --> 00:20:02.250
You're the real thing, Melk-san!

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:09.390
Chef Komatsu...

00:20:11.760 --> 00:20:14.490
Hey! Wait up, I said!

00:20:14.930 --> 00:20:20.100
Only Melk could walk fast 
like that in this gravity!

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:23.370
Hey! Where the hell are you goin'?!

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:30.210
I can't hear you, dammit!

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:32.740
Use that rock again!

00:20:43.890 --> 00:20:45.860
What is this place?

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:53.700
Th-This is...

00:20:57.370 --> 00:21:00.240
A-Amazing...

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:08.910
Dishing with Tina!

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:12.410
It's "Dishing with Tina", the talk 
show with a heaping helping of fun!

00:22:12.410 --> 00:22:16.680
Our guest today is Uumen 
Umeda-san, the IGO Bureau Chief.

00:22:16.680 --> 00:22:18.350
How is everyone today?

00:22:18.350 --> 00:22:20.220
Uumen-san, you've got a 
heaping helping of style

00:22:20.220 --> 00:22:21.850
and are known to be picky about fashion.

00:22:21.850 --> 00:22:26.820
Yes, I'm the fashion leader 
of IGO... or so I call myself!

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:27.790
You call yourself...

00:22:27.790 --> 00:22:31.630
Today, Uumen Umeda is going 
to do a fashion check!

00:22:31.630 --> 00:22:32.400
Let's go!

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:33.800
Uumen Umeda's Fashion Check

00:22:33.800 --> 00:22:35.370
Toriko-chan!

00:22:35.370 --> 00:22:37.900
Wearing clothes with lines that 
accentuate his broad shoulders!

00:22:37.900 --> 00:22:40.440
A wonderful choice that 
has a lot of iyanpact!

00:22:40.440 --> 00:22:42.770
Iyanpact...?

00:22:42.770 --> 00:22:44.880
But it's unfortunate he chose that color.

00:22:44.880 --> 00:22:47.450
Black doesn't fit Toriko-chan's character!

00:22:47.450 --> 00:22:49.710
Black? I don't see...

00:22:50.380 --> 00:22:52.380
That's what you see from your sunglasses!

00:22:53.080 --> 00:22:56.750
Oh! Oh, dear! What am I thinking?!

00:22:57.620 --> 00:23:00.290
IGO is nothing but people like this...

00:23:01.090 --> 00:23:03.700
Let's go on to the next segment...

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:09.110
Precision and soul, forged into a blade.

00:23:09.110 --> 00:23:11.110
Overcoming weakness and tears,

00:23:11.110 --> 00:23:13.750
Melk the Cutler shines bright!

00:23:14.020 --> 00:23:17.330
Debut! the Second Generation's Succession and Melk Stardust!

00:23:17.530 --> 00:23:19.430
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
